{"h":"<h1><strong>通量模式修复工作流程 v1.0</strong></h1><p>此工作流程旨在修复生成的无缝模式。图像以特定方式重建，并且<strong>修复</strong>用于纠正任何不匹配的边缘。在刚刚<strong>两个重涂步骤</strong>，您将获得几乎相同的图像，但具有无缝校正的边框。</p><p>📖 <strong>请阅读文章中更详细的工作流程细分：</strong><br><a href=\"https://civitai.com/articles/12870\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">通量模式修复工作流程 – 详细指南</a></p><p><strong>自定义节点：</strong></p><p>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">rg三舒适</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/shadowcz007/comfyui-mixlab-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfyui-mixlab-节点</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-KJNodes</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_essentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI_essentials</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/sipherxyz/comfyui-art-venture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">舒适艺术冒险</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/theUpsider/ComfyUI-Logic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI逻辑</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/giriss/comfy-image-saver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">舒适图像保护程序</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}